  (UnlinkedSignatures( sigma1, sigma2 ) @ #t01) ∧
  (VerifiedSignatureDeAnonymised( bsn, sigma1, f1 ) @ #t02) ∧
  (VerifiedSignatureDeAnonymised( bsn, sigma2, f2 ) @ #t03)
 ∧
  (¬(sigma1 = sigma2)) ∧ (f1 = f2)"
*/
by sorry

